---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /civil.html
title: "Civil Work"
description: "Civil site design by Zachery Taylor, EI in Pensacola, FL: roadway layout, grading and stormwater, water/sewer/storm utilities, utility conflict analysis, and permitting across land-development and municipal projects — at Mullins, LLC and McKim & Creed."
navKey: civil
sheet: C-101
sheetTitle: "Civil work — scope & history"
---
{%- import "macros.njk" as ui with context -%}
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Civil Work</li></ol>
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("C-101", "Civil work") }}
    <h1>Civil <em>work.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ civil.summary }} Most of my week is spent inside AutoCAD Civil 3D and HydroCAD turning a site into a buildable, permittable plan set.</p>
    <ul class="chips" aria-label="Project types" style="margin-top:22px">
      {%- for t in civil.projectTypes %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="scope-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("C-102", "Scope") }}
    <h2 id="scope-title">What goes into <em>the plan set.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-intro">The pieces of a land-development package I design and coordinate. Client and project names stay private; the scope below reflects the work itself.</p>
    <ul class="sheet-grid">
      {%- for s in civil.scope %}
      <li class="sheet reveal">
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
        <div class="tb" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scope</span><span>{{ s.code }}</span></div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% include "partials/case-studies.njk" %}
    <p class="note"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span><span><strong>Licensing note.</strong> This work was performed as a designer and Engineer Intern under the responsible charge of licensed Professional Engineers. I’m preparing for the Civil PE exam (January 2027).</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="history-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("C-103", "Work history") }}
    <h2 id="history-title">Where I’ve <em>worked.</em></h2>
    <div class="roles">
      {%- for r in civil.roles %}
      <article class="role reveal">
        <div>
          <p class="when">{{ r.dates }}</p>
          <p class="firm">{{ r.firm }}</p>
          <p class="firm-type">{{ r.firmType }} · {{ r.location }}</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ r.role }}</h3>
          <ul>{% for pt in r.points %}<li>{{ pt }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="creds-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ ui.sectionLabel("C-104", "Credentials & tools") }}
    <h2 id="creds-title">Credentials <em>&amp; tools.</em></h2>
    <ul class="cred-list" style="margin-bottom:34px">
      {%- for c in civil.credentials %}<li><strong>{{ c.label }}</strong><span>{{ c.detail }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="tool-groups">
      {%- for group, items in civil.tools %}
      <div>
        <h3>{{ group }}</h3>
        <ul class="chips">{% for t in items %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:34px">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/resume.pdf">Download résumé (PDF)</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/#contact">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
